  "notes": ["The original Nurse pair writes HP and requests its effect, which allocates a kind-2 carrier and one view wrapper. The first bucket visit allocates type-3 heap storage and loads exact common model record 77.","The original neutral replacement actor prefix is followed by its effect bucket and a list rebuild. This is not a full scene update or render path.","Receiver publication follows the same ordinary-guard expiry as the no-effect replay. The live type-21 carrier and its owner bit do not prevent the guard from reopening both lists.","The owner-bit-clear branch is a declared control, not a recovered input or natural bit writer. It stops new emissions and returns the exact heap payload, header, view wrapper and carrier without clearing the receiving role mask.","Actor and common-archive owners stay distinct. No GX draw, audible playback, indefinite behavior, or native gameplay is qualified."],
